      ourApproach: "We gather basis and depreciation records, estimate the combined federal tax exposure, and outline how a full or partial exchange would change that exposure",
      expectedOutcome: "Investor has a clear side-by-side comparison to bring to a tax advisor before deciding how to proceed",
