      ourApproach: "We review the property's use history, estimate current tax exposure, and outline replacement property options if an exchange makes sense",
      expectedOutcome: "Investor understands the tax consequences of each path before committing to a sale strategy",
      contactCTA: "Contact us to discuss your situation in Jacksonville, FL. We can share references upon request.",
